cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the archived release and the manuscript below."
title: "Noise construction and finite-size inference in temporally correlated ballistic deposition"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and analysis code for a numerical study of (1+1)-dimensional ballistic
  deposition with specified shared-innovation AR and Gaussian spectral inputs. The revised
  study validates the final space-time noise field, retains AR covariance cross terms,
  and reports finite-size late-time width slopes with independent-run uncertainty.
  It does not report theta_c or identify historical implementations as erroneous.
